; ==== and each takes the bit that fell out of the byte after it ====
; the bit is nought or one  so the guard runs at most once and adds the
; weight of the top bit; the offset is the same for every byte  which is
; what the tape map was laid out to make true
; the bit from byte 0 joins byte 1
R1
  [-L31
